#. module: om_whatsapp_pos
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_whatsapp_pos
msgid ""
"Bridge between the Point of Sale and the WhatsApp connector of Odoo Mates: "
"the send receipt dialog of the POS gets a WhatsApp number and button; the "
"customer gets the receipt as a picture, with the invoice PDF when the order "
"is invoiced, from a WhatsApp template you can edit. The message is kept on "
"the order; opted-out numbers are skipped."
msgstr ""

